From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Implement exception::_Copy_str/_Tidy, _Interruption_exception and the unobserved exception handler.

exception::_Copy_str (the exception takes its own copy of a message)
and exception::_Tidy (frees an owned message) in msvcr100, msvcr110 and
msvcr120; details::_Interruption_exception (msvcr110, msvcr120), the
exception task collections are cancelled with;
_SetUnobservedExceptionHandler (msvcr110, msvcr120), a function
_ReportUnobservedException calls instead of terminating;
CaptureCallstack in msvcr120 as in msvcp140. msvcr120_app forwards.
