 dlls/msvcrt/concurrency.c           | 76 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 dlls/msvcrt/cpp.c                   | 41 ++++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 164 insertions(+), 49 deletions(-)

